# Powerful Broker: "{T}: For each kind of counter on target permanent or player, give that permanent or player another counter of that
# kind. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1's Grizzly Bears have a +1/+1 counter (Go Nuts!) and flying, first strike and lifelink counters
# (Abigale, Eloquent First-Year): the Broker gives it one more of each of those four kinds (two of each), not four more of one, and none
# of any kind it lacks. Its ability is refused while a spell is on the stack (sorcery speed).

